          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optional name for combining the results of the listed spectrum files, enabled when two or more files are listed: each file is searched on its own, then their spectra and PrSMs are merged, clustered and given FDRs again, and reported as &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;_ms2_toppic_*. A relative name is placed in the folder of the first spectrum file; empty (default): no combined results. (toppic -c, --combined-file-name)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>Combined output file:</string>
