          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check it when the spectrum files report average masses of precursor and fragment ions (TopFD run with --average-mass). Before the search, each &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;_ms2.msalign is converted to &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;_mono_ms2.msalign with monoisotopic masses, which is then searched. Off by default. (toppic -A, --average-mass)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
