       </rect>
      </property>
      <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="horizontalLayout_rescore">
       <item>
        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="rescoreCheckBox">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rank the PrSMs by a rescore instead of the E-value in the FDR computation: the best PrSM of every spectrum gets a score from a linear support vector machine trained on the target and decoy PrSMs with 3-fold cross-validation, and at each level the E-value is used instead when it gives more identifications within the FDR cutoff. The rescoring may underestimate the FDRs. Needs the decoy database; off by default. (toppic -q, --rescore)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>Rescore PrSMs (needs the decoy database)</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
